---
import MaterialSurface from './MaterialSurface.astro';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import site from '../../content/site.json';
import {reviewYandex} from '../content/review-extras';
import '../styles/template.css';
---
<dialog id="review-dialog" class="review-dialog" aria-labelledby="review-dialog-title"><MaterialSurface>
 <div class="dialog-head"><h2 id="review-dialog-title">Оставить отзыв</h2><button class="icon-btn" type="button" data-dismiss aria-label="Закрыть выбор площадки"><Icon name="close" /></button></div>
 <p>Выбери площадку, на которой тебе удобно поделиться впечатлением.</p>
 <div class="review-choices"><a class="btn btn-red" href={reviewYandex} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Яндекс Карты <Icon name="external" /></a><a class="btn btn-blue" href={site.vk} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ВКонтакте <Icon name="external" /></a></div>
</MaterialSurface></dialog>
<script>
 import {openDialog} from '../scripts/motion';
 const dialog=document.querySelector<HTMLDialogElement>('#review-dialog')!;
 for(const trigger of document.querySelectorAll('[data-open-reviews]'))trigger.addEventListener('click',()=>openDialog(dialog));
</script>
